Docs for Developers is an offline documentation browser for developers. It aims to make reading and searching development documentations easy and enjoyable. Docs for Developers supports 100+ documentations: Java, Android, GO, C, C++, Javascript ... 
MAIN FEATURES:
1. Easily downloading hundreds of documentations;
2. Fuzzy search instantly;
3. Clear contents structure;
4. All data stored at local storage;
5. Add / edit bookmarks, synchronize bookmarks to iCloud;
6. Pages are optimized for reading;
7. Navigation by table of contents or navigation bar;
8. Autosave last reading position.
and much more ... 
Take your time and enjoy it! 
